<p class="para">Using a kinetic molecular approach, discuss the differences and similarities between liquids and gases with regard to</p>

<ol start="1" style="list-style-type: lower-alpha;">
    <li>thermal expansion.</li>
    <li>fluidity.</li>
    <li>diffusion.</li>
</ol>

